{"seq":11,"slug":"computational-design-digital-fabrication","title":"计算性设计与数字建造","stage":"DONE","category":"architecture-urban","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/architecture-urban/computational-design-digital-fabrication","rating":{"composite":3.7,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 计算性设计与数字建造\n\n建筑学曾经是一门关于线条的手艺：丁字尺、鸭嘴笔、硫酸纸上反复描摹的平立剖。直到二十世纪末，一种新的工作方式悄然渗入——设计师不再直接画出最终形态，而是写下生成形态的规则，让计算机去推演结果。这个转向看似只是工具更替，实则是建筑思维的根本重构：从「我画一根线」变成「我定义一种关系」，从「设计即绘图」变成「设计即计算」。本 hub 要讲的，正是这场从草图到代码、从图纸到数据、从工地到机器人的连续迁移。\n\n整个 hub 沿四条主线层层递进，每一条都建立在前一条之上。第一条是「参数化与算法设计」——这是全 hub 的方法论地基。当设计被表达为参数、约束和算法，形态就成了可以被求解、被优化、被自动生成的对象；计算几何为这套语言提供了底层数学。没有这层思维转变，后面的一切都无从谈起。\n\n第二条主线是「BIM 与数字工作流」。如果说参数化解决的是「如何生成形态」，BIM 解决的则是「如何让一个建筑成为贯通全生命周期的信息载体」。建筑模型不再只是几何，而是承载了构件属性、性能数据、施工序列与运维信息的数据库；围绕它，性能模拟、多方协同与数字交付构成了一条从设计到运维的数据主线。\n\n第三条主线是「数字建造」，它把虚拟的数据模型推回物理世界。增材制造让混凝土逐层堆叠出无模板的曲面，机器人与数控设备把几何文件直接翻译成切削与装配动作，大规模定制则让「每个构件都不同」从成本灾难变成可行工艺。这是数字链条从比特闭合到原子的关键一跃。\n\n第四条主线是「前沿」，锚定 2025–2026 年正在发生的变革：AI 生成式设计正从二维渲染走向专为建筑训练的三维基础模型，计算可持续把碳排放变成设计阶段就能优化的目标函数，自主建造与现场机器人则让工地本身成为可被算法调度的系统。\n\n读完本 hub，你应当能把握一条完整的逻辑链：规则生成几何、几何承载信息、信息驱动建造、智能闭合反馈。建筑由此从一门手工绘图的技艺，演化为「设计即计算、建造即数据」的工程实践。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"parametric-algorithmic","title":"参数化与算法设计","docCount":3,"url":"/h/architecture-urban/computational-design-digital-fabrication/parametric-algorithmic","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"intro-and-core-concepts","title":"计算性设计导论","url":"/h/architecture-urban/computational-design-digital-fabrication/parametric-algorithmic/intro-and-core-concepts"},{"seq":2,"slug":"parametric-generative-design","title":"参数化建模与生成式设计","url":"/h/architecture-urban/computational-design-digital-fabrication/parametric-algorithmic/parametric-generative-design"},{"seq":3,"slug":"computational-geometry","title":"算法与计算几何","url":"/h/architecture-urban/computational-design-digital-fabrication/parametric-algorithmic/computational-geometry"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"bim-digital-workflow","title":"BIM 与数字工作流","docCount":3,"url":"/h/architecture-urban/computational-design-digital-fabrication/bim-digital-workflow","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"bim-information-model","title":"BIM 原理与信息模型","url":"/h/architecture-urban/computational-design-digital-fabrication/bim-digital-workflow/bim-information-model"},{"seq":2,"slug":"data-driven-performance","title":"数据驱动设计与性能优化","url":"/h/architecture-urban/computational-design-digital-fabrication/bim-digital-workflow/data-driven-performance"},{"seq":3,"slug":"collaboration-digital-delivery","title":"协同与数字交付","url":"/h/architecture-urban/computational-design-digital-fabrication/bim-digital-workflow/collaboration-digital-delivery"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"digital-fabrication","title":"数字建造","docCount":3,"url":"/h/architecture-urban/computational-design-digital-fabrication/digital-fabrication","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"additive-3d-printing","title":"增材制造与 3D 打印","url":"/h/architecture-urban/computational-design-digital-fabrication/digital-fabrication/additive-3d-printing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"robotic-cnc-fabrication","title":"机器人建造与数控加工","url":"/h/architecture-urban/computational-design-digital-fabrication/digital-fabrication/robotic-cnc-fabrication"},{"seq":3,"slug":"mass-customization-assembly","title":"大规模定制与装配","url":"/h/architecture-urban/computational-design-digital-fabrication/digital-fabrication/mass-customization-assembly"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"frontiers","title":"前沿","docCount":3,"url":"/h/architecture-urban/computational-design-digital-fabrication/frontiers","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ai-generative-architecture","title":"AI 与生成式建筑设计","url":"/h/architecture-urban/computational-design-digital-fabrication/frontiers/ai-generative-architecture"},{"seq":2,"slug":"computational-sustainability-materials","title":"计算可持续与材料","url":"/h/architecture-urban/computational-design-digital-fabrication/frontiers/computational-sustainability-materials"},{"seq":3,"slug":"autonomous-construction-future","title":"自主建造与现场机器人","url":"/h/architecture-urban/computational-design-digital-fabrication/frontiers/autonomous-construction-future"}]}]}